  "主要内容": "On June 1, 2020, Freshstart Venture Capital Corp, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Medallion Financial Corp, entered into amendments to the Loan Agreement and Note with U.S. Small Business Administration. The amendments extended the maturity date to September 1, 2020. The amendments were part of ongoing negotiations and finalization of additional changes to the Loan Agreement and Note.",
